 data-name=\"units count value\">8</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#fff0e6] px-3.5 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"special instructions callout\">\n<span class=\"block text-[12px] font-bold text-[#a8541c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"special instructions label\">Special instructions</span>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#3f2a1c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"special instructions text\">Less spice in the biryani. Cut the naan in half and send extra raita.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- Column header -->\n<div class=\"mt-3.5 grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr_120px_140px] items-center pb-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[#7b7f95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"items table column headers\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"quantity column header\">Qty</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"item column header\">Item</span>\n<span class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"unit price column header\">Unit price</span>\n<span class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"amount column header\">Amount</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Rows -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr_120px_140px] items-center border-t border-[#e8eaf3] py-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"biryani order line\">\n<span class=\"ff-manrope text-[24px] font-bold leading-none text-[#15182e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"biryani quantity value\">2</span>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"biryani item cell\">\n<img alt=\"Hyderabadi Dum Biryani — Saveurs Secretes on Pexels\" class=\"h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#f1f2f8] object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"biryani thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/7394819/pexels-photo-7394819.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"truncate text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"biryani item name\">Hyderabadi Dum Biryani</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[15px] text-[#4a4f68]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"biryani unit price\">₹329</span>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[16px] font-bold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4\" data-name=\"biryani row amount\">₹658</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr_120px_140px] items-center border-t border-[#e8eaf3] py-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"butter chicken order line\">\n<span class=\"ff-manrope text-[24px] font-bold leading-none text-[#15182e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"butter chicken quantity value\">1</span>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"butter chicken item cell\">\n<img alt=\"Butter Chicken — Alberta Studios on Pexels\" class=\"h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#f1f2f8] object-cover object-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"butter chicken thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/10615283/pexels-photo-10615283.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"truncate text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"butter chicken item name\">Butter Chicken</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[15px] text-[#4a4f68]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3\" data-name=\"butter chicken unit price\">₹349</span>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[16px] font-bold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-4\" data-name=\"butter chicken row amount\">₹349</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr_120px_140px] items-center border-t border-[#e8eaf3] py-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"garlic naan order line\">\n<span class=\"ff-manrope text-[24px] font-bold leading-none text-[#15182e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"garlic naan quantity value\">3</span>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"garlic naan item cell\">\n<img alt=\"Garlic Naan — Sandra Filipe on Pexels\" class=\"h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#f1f2f8] object-cover object-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"garlic naan thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6183633/pexels-photo-6183633.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"truncate text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"garlic naan item name\">Garlic Naan</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[15px] text-[#4a4f68]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-3\" data-name=\"garlic naan unit price\">₹69</span>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[16px] font-bold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-4\" data-name=\"garlic naan row amount\">₹207</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr_120px_140px] items-center border-t border-[#e8eaf3] py-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7\" data-name=\"gulab jamun order line\">\n<span class=\"ff-manrope text-[24px] font-bold leading-none text-[#15182e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-1\" data-name=\"gulab jamun quantity value\">2</span>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-2\" data-name=\"gulab jamun item cell\">\n<img alt=\"Gulab Jamun — Kulbir on Pexels\" class=\"h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#f1f2f8] object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-2-1\" data-name=\"gulab jamun thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/7449105/pexels-photo-7449105.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"truncate text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-2-2\" data-name=\"gulab jamun item name\">Gulab Jamun</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[15px] text-[#4a4f68]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-3\" data-name=\"gulab jamun unit price\">₹129</span>\n<span class=\"tnum text-right text-[16px] font-bold text-[#1d2036]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-7-4\" data-name=\"gulab jamun row amount\">₹25